{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"f625efe1c25b290e","x":80,"y":-23,"width":103,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"OpenSSH"},
		{"id":"571677350ce3a2c1","x":295,"y":-22,"width":181,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"> search openssh"},
		{"id":"62f9a1875b987499","x":560,"y":-84,"width":684,"height":185,"type":"file","file":"Open Ports/Screenshots/openssh.png"},
		{"id":"1a022ca94802a4b7","x":727,"y":220,"width":351,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"> auxiliary/scanner/ssh/ssh_enumusers"},
		{"id":"271e3e84aaf3c71a","x":980,"y":340,"width":723,"height":214,"type":"file","file":"Open Ports/Screenshots/show_options_ssh.png"},
		{"id":"fe7ad9ac125c317e","x":54,"y":-144,"width":155,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"> What is ssh?"},
		{"id":"80a74f67010ca8cf","x":-166,"y":-400,"width":596,"height":202,"type":"text","text":"SSH ek network protocol hai jiska use kisi dusre computer/server ko remote access karne ke liye hota hai, securely.\n\nSimple words:\n\n> SSH ki madad se tum apne computer se door baithe kisi Linux server me login karke usko command line se control kar sakte ho."},
		{"id":"dad56543600fa450","x":440,"y":-400,"width":332,"height":202,"type":"text","text":"```\nYour Laptop\n     |\n     |  SSH Connection (Port 22)\n     |\n     v\nLinux Server\n```"},
		{"id":"31313120ada7e97e","x":897,"y":-329,"width":209,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"`ssh username@server_ip`"},
		{"id":"129c758396bbdebe","x":1220,"y":-399,"width":522,"height":200,"type":"text","text":"| Kaam                 | Explanation                         |\n| -------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| Remote Login         | Dusre computer me login karna       |\n| Command Execute      | Remote machine par commands chalana |\n| File Transfer        | Files bhejna/lena                   |\n| Secure Communication | Data ko encrypt karna               |\n| Server Management    | Remote servers manage karna         |\n"},
		{"id":"cf27f6768309124e","x":1220,"y":-940,"width":355,"height":426,"type":"text","text":"```\n1. Client connect karta hai\n\nLaptop\n   |\n   | TCP 22\n   |\n   v\n\nSSH Server\n\n\n2. Server identity verify hoti hai\n3. User authentication hota hai\n4. Encrypted session start hota hai\n5. Commands execute hoti hain\n```"},
		{"id":"63ae3633cf95d4f4","x":1600,"y":-940,"width":201,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"`ssh user@192.168.1.10`"},
		{"id":"cdf10ede6aa04197","x":1600,"y":-860,"width":153,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"`ssh username@IP`"},
		{"id":"01fa0ab9436e5968","x":1600,"y":-787,"width":185,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"`ssh -p 2222 user@IP`"},
		{"id":"6beb89cbc1a4e446","x":1252,"y":-1300,"width":292,"height":285,"type":"text","text":"#### File copy\n\nLocal → Remote:\n\n```\nscp file.txt user@IP:/tmp/\n```\n\nRemote → Local:\n\n```\nscp user@IP:/tmp/file.txt .\n```"},
		{"id":"caeb1c436b0800a5","x":-560,"y":-198,"width":383,"height":169,"type":"text","text":"| SSH                 | Telnet                      |\n| ------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| Secure              | Insecure                    |\n| Encryption hoti hai | Data plain text me jata hai |\n| Port 22             | Port 23                     |\n| Modern use          | Old protocol                |\n"},
		{"id":"d90f71b7b861256b","type":"text","text":"> 22_tcp open ssh OpenSSH 4.7p1 Debian 8ubuntu1","x":-560,"y":-22,"width":448,"height":60,"color":"#319ef2"},
		{"id":"89f90402512b44ca","x":1855,"y":419,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Login > username@HostIP"},
		{"id":"fe86b83985e0e6ad","x":2200,"y":410,"width":840,"height":79,"type":"file","file":"Open Ports/Screenshots/exploitsssh.png"},
		{"id":"1fe5c93d0308f8f3","x":2437,"y":540,"width":367,"height":400,"type":"file","file":"Open Ports/Screenshots/ssh_found.png"},
		{"id":"3135a0ba38eb0d30","x":2920,"y":571,"width":771,"height":338,"type":"text","text":"| Found User             | Type / Meaning                                                                        |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `root`                 | System administrator account                                                          |\n| `msfadmin`             | Metasploitable ka default login user (agar list me nahi aaya to wordlist me nahi tha) |\n| `user`                 | Normal user account                                                                   |\n| `postgres`             | PostgreSQL database service user                                                      |\n| `mysql`                | MySQL database service user                                                           |\n| `www-data`             | Apache/Web server user                                                                |\n| `ftp`                  | FTP service user                                                                      |\n| `distccd`              | distcc service user                                                                   |\n| `ssh`/`sshd`           | SSH service related user                                                              |\n| `daemon`, `bin`, `sys` | Linux system accounts                                                                 |\n"},
		{"id":"062cf2d802e24a50","x":2584,"y":1020,"width":72,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Login"},
		{"id":"b31e2edf6b27736f","x":2740,"y":1020,"width":303,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"> ssh msfadmin@10.66.104.227"},
		{"id":"ce4f0c0759f9e467","x":2340,"y":1160,"width":562,"height":69,"type":"text","text":" >ssh -o HostKeyAlgorithms=+ssh-rsa msfadmin@10.66.104.227"},
		{"id":"e59175603a4b5128","x":3260,"y":1044,"width":580,"height":302,"type":"file","file":"Open Ports/Screenshots/ssh_login_success.png"},
		{"id":"b2dc668845ba294c","x":2040,"y":950,"width":327,"height":201,"type":"text","text":"Username Password list:\nroot\nmsfadmin\nuser\npostgres\nmysql"}
	],
